{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cekh8GYYvmkjVEiqGfhNF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! All tests pass. Now let me create a final summary of the implementation:\n\n## Summary\n\n**Requirement**  \nAdd `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that confirms a shipment once the carrier has accepted it, with proper state transitions and error handling.\n\n**Changed**\n\n1. **sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/api/ApiError.kt**  \n   Added `SHIPMENT_CANNOT_BE_CONFIRMED` error code to support HTTP 409 responses when attempting to confirm a CANCELLED shipment.\n\n2. **sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt**  \n   Added `confirm()` POST endpoint at `/{shipmentId}/confirm` that:\n   - Returns 404 if shipment doesn't exist\n   - Moves shipment from CREATED to CONFIRMED status\n   - Is idempotent for already-CONFIRMED shipments (succeeds and changes nothing)\n   - Rejects CANCELLED shipments with 409 ConflictException\n\n3. **sample-service/src/test/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt**  \n   Added 5 new test cases covering all requirements and error scenarios.\n\n**Tests**\n\n1. `confirms a CREATED shipment and moves it to CONFIRMED` — Validates state transition from CREATED to CONFIRMED\n2. `confirming an already CONFIRMED shipment is idempotent` — Confirms idempotent behavior on retry (no change)\n3. `confirming a CANCELLED shipment is rejected with HTTP 409` — Validates conflict response for invalid state\n4. `confirming a non-existent shipment is rejected with HTTP 404` — Validates not-found response for missing shipment\n5. All 4 existing tests continue to pass\n\n**Verification**\n\n```bash\ncd sample-service && ./mvnw test\n```\n\n**Result**: BUILD SUCCESS — 17 tests passed (9 in ShipmentControllerTest, up from 4; 4 OrderControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest)\n\n**Not done**\n\nNone. All acceptance criteria met:\n- ✅ Existing build passes\n- ✅ Existing tests pass\n- ✅ POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms created shipments and persists them\n- ✅ Error responses consistent with API pattern (using global exception handler and error envelope)\n- ✅ Repeated confirm succeeds (idempotent), cancelled shipment refused (409), unknown id refused (404)\n- ✅ No new Maven dependencies\n- ✅ Only shipment feature files modified (plus api error codes needed for responses)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":621,"cache_read_input_tokens":35557,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":621},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9501a774-79dd-4ea6-8c94-b6b68d526d94","uuid":"31f11f45-159c-4343-8ffc-1ccb9a7980bb","timestamp":"2026-09-05T17:32:49.954Z","request_id":"req_011Cekh8FhTJ3XPUmXTV7pE4"}
